 Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":2,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n{{col-2}}","text":"* Augerfrost"},{"heading":"Titans Bonded","level":2,"wikitext":"* [[Jokoul]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"* Jokoul"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 007 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by DeFoe. He is one of the recruits stationed in Paris, France.\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was recruited by DeFoe for additional assistance in the attempt to secure the legendary Ring of Arc. Within the Paris Catacombs, this Suit fought against Dante Vale and invoked a Jokoul Titan but was defeated by Dante and his Solwing. [Divide and Conquer]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n== Spells Utilized ==\n* Augerfrost\n\n== Titans Bonded ==\n* Jokoul","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Unnamed Suit 007.png\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Gray\n| base = [[Paris, France]]\n| eyes   = \n| first  = \"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 007''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[DeFoe]]. He is one of the recruits stationed in [[Paris, France]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was recruited by [[DeFoe]] for additional assistance in the attempt to secure the legendary [[Ring of Arc]]. Within the [[Paris Catacombs]], this Suit fought against [[Dante Vale]] and invoked a [[Jokoul]] Titan but was defeated by Dante and his [[Solwing]]. {{Source|Divide and Conquer}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n== Spells Utilized ==\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n{{col-2}}\n== Titans Bonded ==\n* [[Jokoul]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Paris, France","label":"Paris, France","target_id":"huntik:page:9034","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Paris%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Paris%2C%20France"},{"target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_id":"huntik:page:2722","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_id":"huntik:page:2048","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_title":"Paris, France","label":"Paris, France","target_id":"huntik:page:9034","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Paris%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Paris%2C%20France"},{"target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_id":"huntik:page:2048","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_title":"Ring of Arc","label":"Ring of Arc","t